From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:14:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: hwlock: sun6i: Add compatible for Allwinner A733

The A733 spinlock unit has 32 locks (A733 manual, 6.2.1). Its
SPINLOCK_SYSTATUS reads 0x10000000 at reset, LOCKS_NUM = 1 for 32
locks (6.2.6.1), and lock n sits at 0x100 + 4 * n, where a read of 0
takes the lock and a write of 0 frees it (6.2.6.10). That is the
register model of the sun6i driver. Like the A31 unit it has a bus
gate and a reset (4.1.6.87) and no module clock.

Add "allwinner,sun60i-a733-hwspinlock" with
"allwinner,sun6i-a31-hwspinlock" as the fallback.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the driver binds through the fallback and
reports 32 locks.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../bindings/hwlock/allwinner,sun6i-a31-hwspinlock.yaml          | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwlock/allwinner,sun6i-a31-hwspinlock.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwlock/allwinner,sun6i-a31-hwspinlock.yaml
index 13f9a20ae18f..7dce5329a656 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwlock/allwinner,sun6i-a31-hwspinlock.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/hwlock/allwinner,sun6i-a31-hwspinlock.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - allwinner,sun20i-d1-hwspinlock
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-hwspinlock
           - const: allwinner,sun6i-a31-hwspinlock
 
   reg:
